    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Darragh O Se are thrilled to bring to the market 9 The Scallops, Main Street, Ballybunion. No 9 is an attractive property ideally located in the popular seaside town of Ballybunion, Co. Kerry. \r\nBallybunion is renowned for its stunning beaches, dramatic Atlantic coastline and vibrant holiday atmosphere. The property is located on the Main Street and has all local amenities on its doorstep such as a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs and the infamous Ballybunion Beach. The renowned Ballybunion Golf Course is also nearby, making this an ideal location for enjoying the best that the coast of Kerry has to offer.\r\nThe accommodation offers comfortable living space with excellent potential to create a welcoming family home or an attractive coastal retreat. Viewing in highly recommended. BER Pending."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.5m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.2m x 3.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nW.C - 1.7m x 1.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.0m x 3.7m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.3m x 3.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 3.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 1.0m x 2.3m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 5.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 2.0m x 3.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
